---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="wrap section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <SectionHeading id="about">About</SectionHeading>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I studied AI and machine learning at Anurag University in Hyderabad, and I’m now doing my M.S. in Data Science, Analytics and
      Engineering at Arizona State University.
    </p>
    <p>
      The part I enjoy most is what happens after the model works. Getting an answer to exactly one person in a live meeting, making a
      Rust resolver fast enough to index tokio, proving that 18.9 million records each landed in exactly one place: those are the
      problems I keep coming back to.
    </p>
    <p>I like work I can measure, and I would rather write down what something can’t do yet than leave it out.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: var(--section-gap);
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
</style>
